## Overlap with custom rules

List rules in vendored packs that are already covered by `.semgrep/<app>/`.
Disable the duplicate in the pack (via `--exclude-rule <id>`) to keep output clean.

## Promotion / demotion candidates

- Rules to promote from warn → error in `regulated` profile
- Rules to demote from error → warn (too noisy)
- Rules to disable entirely (low signal)

